{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/timeout\/batch(strategy:)"]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Timeout"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Gathers elements into arrays and emits each array when the strategy says to flush."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"batch","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Strategy","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"strategy","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Strategy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","text":"AsyncSequences","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Batch","text":"Batch","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO5BatchV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Strategy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Strategy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy","text":"BatchStrategy","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent13BatchStrategyP"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sci7ElementQa"},{"text":" == ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Strategy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/Element","text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent13BatchStrategyP7ElementQa"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"strategy","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When to emit the gathered elements; its ","type":"text"},{"code":"Element","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sequence’s, inferred from the call.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","level":2,"text":"Return Value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A sequence of the upstream’s elements, in order, in arrays of one or more."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The strategy decides when the pending elements are flushed: every so many elements"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/count(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":"), every interval"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/time(interval:clock:tolerance:)"},{"type":"text","text":"), on a signal or a unit of work"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/SignalBatchStrategy"},{"type":"text","text":"), whenever any of several does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/either(_:_:)"},{"type":"text","text":"), or by a rule of your own ("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy"},{"type":"text","text":"). After every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"flush, each strategy starts over. A flush with nothing pending emits nothing; the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence never emits an empty array."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When the upstream finishes, the pending elements, if any, are emitted as a last array and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the sequence finishes. When the upstream throws, the pending elements are dropped and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence throws the same error. A signal that finishes stops firing while the batches go"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on; a signal that throws ends the sequence with its error."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The upstream and the strategy run in tasks of their own, started when iteration begins,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so the upstream is read ahead of the consumer, and arrays the consumer hasn’t taken yet","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are buffered. Cancelling the consumer, or dropping its iterator, cancels both. An","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"upstream or signal that ignores cancellation keeps the internal task alive until its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pending ","type":"text"},{"code":"next()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" returns, and is not read again after that; the batched sequence itself","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ends at once.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Batching needs iOS 16, Mac Catalyst 16, macOS 13, tvOS 16, watchOS 9 or visionOS 1.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Example","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Example"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["for try await batch in [1, 2, 3, 4].async.batch(strategy: .either(.count(3), .time(interval: .seconds(1), clock: ContinuousClock()))) {","    print(batch) \/\/ Prints [1, 2, 3], then [4]","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"aside","name":"Throws","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Any error the upstream or the strategy throws."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"batch"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncSequences","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Batch","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO5BatchV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Element"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}]},"title":"batch(strategy:)","modules":[{"relatedModules":["_Concurrency"],"name":"Afluent"}],"externalID":"s:Sci7Afluents8SendableRzsAB7ElementRpzrlE5batch8strategyAA14AsyncSequencesO5BatchVy_xqd__Gqd___tAA0H8StrategyRd__ACQyd__ADRSlF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO7TimeoutV","remoteSource":{"fileName":"BatchSequence.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/Seq